  "body": "Secure an exceptional opportunity to own a luxurious new home in the highly sought-after Millwater community. Currently under construction by renowned developer Dream Concept Homes, this stunning residence is expected to be completed early 2027, just in time to enjoy summer by the heated pool and embrace a resort-style lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDesigned with both comfort and sophistication in mind, this impressive home offers 5 generous bedrooms and 3 beautifully appointed bathrooms, providing ample space for families of all sizes. Showcasing striking modern architecture and the quality craftsmanship Dream Concept Homes is known for, every detail has been carefully considered to deliver a home of exceptional standard.\r\n\r\nA unique advantage for early purchasers is the opportunity to personalise selected interior colour schemes, allowing you to add your own touch and create a home that truly reflects your style.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the designer kitchen will feature premium appliances, a spacious walk-in pantry, and an additional prep sink-perfect for those who love to cook and entertain. The expansive open-plan living and dining area flows effortlessly to a north-west facing deck, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor connection ideal for entertaining guests or enjoying relaxed family living.\r\n\r\nThe flexible floor plan includes 2 bedrooms and a bathroom on the ground level, offering excellent options for guests, extended family, teenagers, or a home office. Upstairs, you'll find a further 3 bedrooms, including a luxurious master suite designed as a private retreat.\r\n\r\nPositioned within the rapidly growing Arran Hills precinct, this location continues to attract buyers seeking convenience and lifestyle. Centrally located between Orewa and Silverdale, residents enjoy easy access to shopping, cafés, restaurants, parks, quality schools, and the picturesque Orewa Estuary Walkway. Millwater is a thriving, family-friendly community that perfectly balances neighbourhood charm with modern conveniences.\r\n\r\nFor buyers who appreciate quality and refuse to compromise, this home is sure to impress. Contact Sarah today and discover why so many happy homeowners have chosen to buy a new build with Dream Concept Homes in Millwater and beyond.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Plans, specifications, and finishes are subject to change from time to time. Images shown are from previous similar builds and are indicative only.",
